## Quick Start

1. Install dependencies (Python + healpy + numpy + scipy).
2. Download Planck/SDSS data using the links in `/data`.
3. Run the relaxation solver to generate `T_sim`.
4. Compute the residual map `ΔT`.
5. Analyze the power spectrum and conservation audit.

